alternative_name: Papaya Yogurt Bowl
ingredient_count: 5
---

  Cut the @papaya{1} in half and scoop out the seeds.

Scoop the @coconut yogurt{5%ounces} into the center wells of the papaya, dividing it equally between each side. Using the back of a #spoon{}, spread it to cover the center of the papaya.

Divide the @granola{1/2%cup}, @blueberries{1/4%cup}, and @cherries{1/4%cup}(halved) between the papaya halves. Drizzle on the @honey{2%teaspoons}.

Serve immediately.